	(descr "6P 2.54mm pitch magnetic pogo connector from mechanical drawing: body 24.62 x 4.00 mm stadium (R2.00), 6 contacts on 2.54 mm pitch, 6 x D1.50 barrels, D0.90 plunger, 18.62 mm between N/S magnet centres. Solder tail is not dimensioned, so the 1.70 mm pad / 1.00 mm drill land pattern is GENERIC, and pin 1 = N pole is an ASSUMPTION. Confirm both with the vendor drawing before production. Vertical variant: pad row under the body centre.")
